    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap Flight Telemetry Blackbox Binary Recorder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>High-speed binary logger for SPI Flash or SD Card logging. Frame Formats:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&apos;H&apos; (Header): ASCII configuration settings and flight controller parameters.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&apos;I&apos; (Intra Frame): Full uncompressed 32-bit state vector (Gyro, Accel, Motor outputs, Setpoints).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&apos;P&apos; (Predictive Delta Frame): Compact variable-length ZigZag delta encoded frame. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
